      "For you, the power to be reborn from the bottom lies on the same road as your soul's direction. Life's great turning points arrive with unusual fatefulness, and each passage through collapse and rising makes the road clearer. Undergoing change is itself your task. Just know that intensity can feel like too much — when the big wave comes, ride it rather than brace against it. However many times you're reborn, every one of those transformations is carrying you toward your true road.",
    flow: "You're someone whose power of transformation props up the direction of growth from deep below. Each crisis you pass through makes the road sharper, and exactly as much as you let go, new strength fills in. It's a placement where the force of regeneration flows in your favor. Just know that trusting that force into controlling everything clogs the current — leave at least one thing you grip to the flow. That muscle of falling and standing again is the second wind that guards your road to the end.",
    square:
      "Inside you, the force that would change everything wholesale and the direction your soul points clash fiercely. The urge to overturn your life and the doubt of is this the road swirl together, so the labor pains at each turning point run unusually large. The torrent is frightening, but it's really the force peeling off the old shell. Just don't push by force alone or you'll shatter too; first sort what to break from what to keep. Each time you pass that discernment, you stand again one layer deeper.",
