    9: "Your heart breathes in open country. On stifling days, a walk through a strange neighborhood or one new lesson works far better than comforting words. Feeling steadies when you find meaning, so even today's hardship becomes bearable read as a chapter of the story. The heavier the heart, the farther you should set your gaze.",
